invalid type: string "5. Verified Chemical Interventions\nFoliar spray targeted at the base of the plant: Hexaconazole 5% EC @ 2.0 mL/L or Validamycin 3% L @ 2.0 mL/L or\nThifluzamide 24% SC @ 0.75 mL/L or Azoxystrobin 18.2% + Difenoconazole 11.4% SC @ 1.0 mL/L at the first\nappearance of symptoms. Direct spray toward lower sheaths near the water line.\nAvoid excess nitrogen; apply\n7ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ